{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"center","type":"text","x":-160,"y":900,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"1","text":"# 🧠 AI Engineer\n# 知识体系\n\n六大能力域 · 三层掌握深度\n→ [[00-总索引|学习路线]]"},
		{"id":"group-a","type":"group","x":300,"y":0,"width":1400,"height":310,"color":"1","label":"A · 模型内功 — 理解模型行为（目录 01, 02, 13）","background":"transparent"},
		{"id":"group-b","type":"group","x":300,"y":330,"width":1400,"height":250,"color":"2","label":"B · 硬件与推理 — 跑得快、跑得便宜（目录 03, 14, 15）","background":"transparent"},
		{"id":"group-c","type":"group","x":300,"y":600,"width":1400,"height":310,"color":"3","label":"C · 系统工程 — demo 变可运维系统（目录 08, 09, 10）","background":"transparent"},
		{"id":"group-d","type":"group","x":300,"y":930,"width":1400,"height":250,"color":"4","label":"D · 上下文与检索 — 管好信息流（目录 06, 07, 11）","background":"transparent"},
		{"id":"group-e","type":"group","x":300,"y":1200,"width":1400,"height":310,"color":"5","label":"E · 质量与安全 — 度量与防御（目录 04, 05, 12）","background":"transparent"},
		{"id":"group-f","type":"group","x":300,"y":1530,"width":1400,"height":310,"color":"6","label":"F · 产品与落地 — 技术变用户价值（目录 16–19）","background":"transparent"},
		{"id":"group-mental","type":"group","x":-160,"y":1870,"width":1860,"height":530,"color":"1","label":"跨域心智模型 — 8 条贯穿全栈的高阶框架","background":"transparent"},
		{"id":"dom-a","type":"text","x":340,"y":30,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"1","text":"## A · 模型内功\n理解模型行为\n——为什么在这些输入上\n对了、在那些上崩了"},
		{"id":"dom-b","type":"text","x":340,"y":360,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"2","text":"## B · 硬件与推理\n模型怎么跑起来、\n怎么跑得快、\n怎么跑得便宜"},
		{"id":"dom-c","type":"text","x":340,"y":630,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"3","text":"## C · 系统工程\n把模型调用 demo\n变成可上线、\n可运维的系统"},
		{"id":"dom-d","type":"text","x":340,"y":960,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"4","text":"## D · 上下文与检索\n模型「看到什么」\n和「记住什么」"},
		{"id":"dom-e","type":"text","x":340,"y":1230,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"5","text":"## E · 质量与安全\n度量系统好不好、\n防住它不被利用"},
		{"id":"dom-f","type":"text","x":340,"y":1560,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"6","text":"## F · 产品与落地\n把技术能力\n变成用户价值\n并持续迭代"},
		{"id":"a1","type":"text","x":680,"y":30,"width":300,"height":50,"color":"1","text":"**A1 Transformer 机制**\nQ/K/V 投影 → attention 计算 → causal mask → 残差"},
		{"id":"a2","type":"text","x":680,"y":90,"width":300,"height":50,"color":"1","text":"**A2 Tokenization 与采样**\nBPE 原理 · temperature/top-p/top-k · logprobs 用法"},
		{"id":"a3","type":"text","x":680,"y":150,"width":300,"height":50,"color":"1","text":"**A3 架构与权重的区别**\nconfig.json 十几个数字 · .safetensors 张量名对号"},
		{"id":"a4","type":"text","x":680,"y":210,"width":300,"height":50,"color":"1","text":"**A4 评测与选型**\n基准在测什么 · 排行榜怎么用 · 硬约束→收窄→定夺"},
		{"id":"a5","type":"text","x":680,"y":270,"width":300,"height":50,"color":"1","text":"**A5 推理时计算**\nCoT 原理 · test-time compute · thinking budget 控制"},
