		{"id":"b3","type":"text","x":680,"y":480,"width":300,"height":50,"color":"2","text":"**B3 推理引擎机制**\nPagedAttention · continuous batching · prefix caching · 量化"},
		{"id":"b4","type":"text","x":680,"y":540,"width":300,"height":50,"color":"2","text":"**B4 容量与成本**\n显存 = 权重 + KV cache + 开销 · QPS 估算"},
